---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const calendly = 'https://calendly.com/contact-advised-seo/30min?back=1';
const jsonLd = JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "CollectionPage",
      "@id": "https://www.afrirank.fr/en/seo-african-heritage-brands/#page",
      "url": "https://www.afrirank.fr/en/seo-african-heritage-brands/",
      "name": "SEO for African & Black-owned brands | AfriRank",
      "description": "Your brand creates the demand; your resellers cash in. See how to reclaim your direct sales on Google and in AI answers.",
      "inLanguage": "en",
      "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://www.afrirank.fr/#website" },
      "about": { "@id": "https://www.afrirank.fr/#afrirank" }
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.afrirank.fr/en/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "SEO for African & Black-owned brands", "item": "https://www.afrirank.fr/en/seo-african-heritage-brands/" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "inLanguage": "en",
      "mainEntity": [
        { "@type": "Question", "name": "Who is AfriRank for?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "For established African & Black-owned brands (skincare, haircare, beauty, food, fashion) that already have demand but watch their resellers and marketplaces capture the sales on Google." } },
        { "@type": "Question", "name": "Do I need an e-commerce site already?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. AfriRank works with brands that already sell online and want to win back their traffic and their direct sales." } },
        { "@type": "Question", "name": "Where do we start?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "With the Diagnostic: we quantify the leak and set priorities. Execution comes next, in-house or as an engagement." } },
        { "@type": "Question", "name": "Does AfriRank also handle visibility in AI answers?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Visibility in ChatGPT, Perplexity and Google AI is a core part of the strategy (GEO)." } }
      ]
    }
  ]
});
---
<Base
  title="SEO for African & Black-owned brands | AfriRank"
  description="Your brand creates the demand; your resellers cash in. See how to reclaim your direct sales on Google and in AI answers."
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
  lang="en"
  frPath="/seo-marques-afro-caribeennes/"
  enPath="/en/seo-african-heritage-brands/">

<section class="hero hero--page wrap">
  <div class="hero-top">
    <nav class="breadcrumb reveal" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/en/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span>
      <span>SEO for African & Black-owned brands</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="hero-eyebrow reveal"><img src="/images/icon-orange.png" alt="" /> Pillar guide</span>
    <h1 class="reveal">SEO for African & Black-owned brands: <em>take back control of your sales</em>.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub reveal">Your brand has the community, the recognition and the products. Yet when your customers look for you on Google, it's often your resellers and the marketplaces that capture the sale. AfriRank exists to flip that: bring the organic revenue back where it belongs — to you.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:clamp(20px,3vw,40px)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <figure class="article-figure reveal">
      <img src="/images/article-pilier.jpg" alt="Stacks of ankara African-print fabric on a market stall" loading="lazy" width="1280" height="560" />
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap article reveal">
    <h2>The real problem for established Black-owned brands</h2>
    <p>It isn't a lack of recognition. It's a problem of <strong>capture</strong>: the demand you created turns into sales for other people.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>A customer searches your product category → they land on a reseller.</li>
      <li>They search your brand + a product → the marketplace outranks your own listing.</li>
      <li>They ask an AI (ChatGPT, Perplexity) → your brand isn't cited.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Every time, you lose margin, customer data and control of your image. To put a number on that leak, see the page <a href="/en/recover-revenue-from-resellers/">recover the revenue your resellers are capturing</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="kicker">The map</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">The three territories to win back.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="hub-grid">
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/own-your-branded-serp/">
        <span class="k">Territory 1</span>
        <h3>Your branded SERP</h3>
        <p>When someone types your name, you should own the ground before any reseller. It's the fastest win.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/reclaim-demand-from-marketplaces/">
        <span class="k">Territory 2</span>
        <h3>Your category queries</h3>
        <p>Non-branded searches (product type, ingredient, use case) should lead to your pages, not the marketplaces.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/ai-visibility-geo-black-brands/">
        <span class="k">Territory 3</span>
        <h3>Your presence in AI (GEO)</h3>
        <p>Answer engines are becoming a buying entry point. A brand that isn't cited disappears from the recommendation.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="kicker">By product world</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">SEO by product world.</h2>
      <p>Each world has its own queries, its own competition and its own codes. Choose yours.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hub-grid">
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/seo-afro-haircare/"><span class="k">Vertical</span><h3>Afro &amp; textured haircare</h3><p>Type 4 / 4C hair, curls, ingredients, routines: an ultra-granular, ultra-qualified world.</p></a>
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/seo-makeup-black-skin/"><span class="k">Vertical</span><h3>Beauty &amp; makeup for Black skin</h3><p>Deep skin tones, undertones, shade matching: the hottest buying intent on the market.</p></a>
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/seo-african-caribbean-grocery/"><span class="k">Vertical</span><h3>African &amp; Caribbean grocery</h3><p>The sale hides behind the recipe and the ingredient. Connect one to the other.</p></a>
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/seo-afro-fashion-lifestyle/"><span class="k">Vertical</span><h3>African-print fashion &amp; lifestyle</h3><p>Ankara, accessories, home: own your style before the marketplaces and dropshippers.</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="kicker">By platform</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">SEO by platform.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="hub-grid">
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/seo-shopify-black-owned-brands/"><span class="k">Guide</span><h3>Shopify SEO for Black-owned brands</h3><p>Shopify's strengths and constraints (collections, product pages, speed) to win back your sales.</p></a>
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/seo-woocommerce-black-owned-brands/"><span class="k">Guide</span><h3>WooCommerce / PrestaShop SEO</h3><p>Architectural freedom: your best SEO asset, and your worst duplicate-content trap.</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="kicker">Frequently asked</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">The questions every brand asks.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="hub-grid">
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/resellers-capture-brand-traffic/"><h3>The 4 leaks: where your traffic goes to resellers</h3></a>
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/why-resellers-outrank-your-brand/"><h3>Why do my resellers outrank my own brand?</h3></a>
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/ecommerce-seo-pricing/"><h3>How much does SEO cost for an e-commerce brand?</h3></a>
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/what-is-geo/"><h3>What is GEO (visibility in AI answers)?</h3></a>
      <a class="hub-card reveal" href="/en/marketplace-vs-brand-site/"><h3>Marketplace vs brand site: who captures the traffic?</h3></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap article reveal">
    <h2>Why AfriRank</h2>
    <p>I'm Francis, an SEO consultant with 11 years in the field. AfriRank serves one audience only: established African & Black-owned brands that want to stop funding their resellers' growth. A clear number, a map of the leaks, a prioritised plan. Nothing more, nothing less. Two free tools to get started: the <a href="/en/lost-organic-revenue-calculator/">lost organic revenue calculator</a> and the <a href="/en/brand-visibility-scorecard/">brand visibility scorecard</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="kicker">Frequently asked</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Everything you need to know.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
      <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">Who is AfriRank for? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>For established African & Black-owned brands (skincare, haircare, beauty, food, fashion) that already have demand but watch their resellers and marketplaces capture the sales on Google.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">Do I need an e-commerce site already? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. AfriRank works with brands that already sell online and want to win back their traffic and their direct sales.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">Where do we start? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>With the Diagnostic: we quantify the leak and set priorities. Execution comes next, in-house or as an engagement.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">Does AfriRank also handle visibility in AI answers? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Visibility in ChatGPT, Perplexity and Google AI is a core part of the strategy (GEO).</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <img src="/images/icon-cream.png" class="icon-watermark" alt="" />
      <h2>Where to start: the Diagnostic.</h2>
      <p>A single session that measures the organic revenue your resellers are capturing, pinpoints your blind spots and maps the plan to win it back. €290 (~$310), credited toward your first month if you continue with an engagement.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href={calendly} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--orange">Book the Diagnostic
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/seo-diagnostic/" class="btn btn--cream">Learn more</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Base>
